  "prefLabel": "He-W 950.04 Release of Public Use Data Sets",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 950.04 Release of Public Use Data Sets.\n\n(a) Public use data sets collected or generated by the department or its designee shall be made available in public use files and provided to any person upon written request, except where otherwise prohibited by law.\n\n(b) A person may request public use data sets by completing and submitting a “Request Form for NH Commercial Claims Public Use Data Set” (December 2024).\n\nSource. #8600, eff 4-6-06; ss by #10703, eff 10-23-14 (from He-W 950.05); ss by #14166, eff 1-7-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w900.html"
